.Dd October 4, 2026
.Dt XLOCK-SCREEN 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xlock-screen
.Nd lock the screen
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar xlock-args
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
locks the screen on
.Sy Super+L .
It runs
.Xr xlock-invoke 1
with the class
.Cm xlock-screen
and passes
.Ar xlock-args
through to
.Xr xlock 1 .
That class is opaque: a black underlay sits behind the saver so a
random mode cannot show the desktop.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The exit status is that of
.Xr xlock-invoke 1 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bhotkeys 1 ,
.Xr xlock 1 ,
.Xr xlock-invoke 1 ,
.Xr xlock-run 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Devin Teske Aq Mt dteske@FreeBSD.org
